WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.800
Do I think that there's ever a situation where

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:07.620
you can break the law for the better or the greater good?

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:11.860
You know, immigration is a, it's an interesting issue

